WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:01.751
Atom is already on his way!

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:09.592
Uran!

00:00:11.052 --> 00:00:11.970
Atom?

00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:14.389
I'm headed your way.

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:16.224
Atom!

00:00:16.307 --> 00:00:17.934
Your signal's too weak!

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:19.310
I'm almost there.

00:00:21.062 --> 00:00:21.896
Atom.

00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:24.858
Uran, what…

00:00:30.071 --> 00:00:31.406
What was that?

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.410
You can have the whole body for 500 ZEUS.

00:00:36.119 --> 00:00:37.203
Gesicht?

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:38.830
Atom!

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:40.832
What's wrong, Uran?

00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:41.875
…n't come here…

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:44.419
What's wrong, Uran?

00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:46.421
No! You have to stay away!

00:00:50.091 --> 00:00:51.968
Uran, I'm coming!

00:00:54.679 --> 00:00:55.555
No.

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:58.433
Stay away!

00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:05.815
Run, Uran!

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:07.650
Atom!

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:10.111
Take Bobby and get down to the basement!

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:13.156
-Okay, but what about--
-Go now!

00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:19.287
What is that?

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:25.752
Atom, what is this?

00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:27.045
Stand back, Uran!

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:36.846
Atom!

